 "notes": "CREDITS.md credits the music only by pack (Junkala JRPG Packs #1-#5 CC0, GT RPG soundtrack CC-BY 4.0, the 18 expansion tracks from gt-rpg-sountrack_2.zip as OGA-BY 3.0, Hydrogene 16-bit Battle Theme I CC0); the 18 expansion titles are listed in CREDITS.md verbatim, the per-file mapping of the other tracks comes from the build scripts (scratchpad dm/build_assets.py MUS table and expand-dawnmark/build_music.py), track titles taken from the source file names. All files are MP3 only (no .ogg/.m4a). js/audio.js has no procedural songs: the chip only plays short fanfares and sound effects over the music. Five committed tracks are never played and are listed in skipped (could be added as 'other' if the gallery wants unused tracks)."
